menu "Arctic Controller"

    config TEST_ENDPOINTS
        bool "Enable test instrumentation endpoints (/api/test/*)"
        default y
        help
            Enables REST API endpoints for UI testing:
            - GET /api/test/ui-state  (read LVGL widget tree)
            - POST /api/test/click    (click widget by label text)
            These endpoints are intended for automated testing only
            and should be disabled in production builds.

endmenu
